     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi,</div><div><br></div><div>I would like to recreate Edwards (2011. The Fallacy of Formative Measurement: Figure 5) formative model replacement with facet constructs and single reflective measures (attached figure) in lavaan. In this model, the lambdas and the deltas must to fixed to constants to achieve identification. I am happy for any help.</div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Rico<br></div></div>"
    ]
