    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Thank you Matt. I tried the model which gives gives &#39;unknown operator&#39;. I missed writing out the model, but also tried N ~ E1 + E2 + E3 which gives &#39;missing observed variable in dataset&#39;. The full attempt is written below (a:s and b:s to constrain the variance). <br><div></div><div><br></div><div>#Measurement models<br></div><div><div>E1 =~ a*X1</div><div>\r\n<div>E2 =~ a*X2</div>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div>E3 =~ a*X3</div><div><br></div><div>#Structural model<br></div><div>N ~ E1 + E2 + E3</div><div><br></div><div>#Variance</div><div>X1~b*X1<br></div><div>X2~b*X2</div><div>X3~b*X3</div><div><br></div><div>#Covariance<br></div></div></div>"
    ],
