    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>I think it is because you are using just one observable variable to create the latent variable. Try something like this below adding one more observable variable to the loop. <br></div><div>And I suggest to try first the MM and SM first and then just after adding the cov and variances.<br></div><div><br></div><div>\r\n<div>#Measurement models<br></div><div><div>E1 =~ a*X1 + b*X2</div><div>\r\n<div>E2 =~ c*X3 + d\r\n*X4\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</div></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div>\r\n<div></div><div><br></div><div>#Structural model<br></div><div>N ~ E1 + E2 <br></div><div><br></div></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><div>Best Regards</div><div>Matt.<br></div></div>\r\n\r\n</div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
